message: "If you use this code, corpus, or results, please cite the paper."
title: "Edge-Native Semantic Firewall for Autonomous LLM Agents: A Structured Chain-of-Thought Verification Framework"
type: conference
authors:
  - family-names: Poudel
    given-names: Sushant
    email: sushant.poudel2028@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Nepal Engineering College, Bhaktapur, Nepal"
